  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for PostQuantum.SecureChannel. Adds AddPostQuantumSecureChannel() DI registration with IConfiguration binding (server identity seed, pinned client keys, session preset), a PqWebSocketStream adapter that wraps any WebSocket as an encrypted Stream, a MapPqWebSocket() endpoint helper for minimal APIs, and a ws.AcceptPqClientAsync() client-side extension. Host a post-quantum secure WebSocket endpoint in roughly five lines of Program.cs.",
